{"title":"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2e1b0ba956727e6f0846bd63f48b8c351b31a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A = 60^\\circ$\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/3/b33ea61d73f18a160eff36e36141914aee2c8e46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle E = 40^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/e/a8e8412e08e2d449f2697107b7292d685f7f63d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C = 30^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/e/36efd234decc144f9e0ebec504f73ed624832323.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BDC =$\" width=\"76\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/d/f0dc899c415371f7deef8daea361750c75ff942f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,B,C,D,EE; A = origin; B = (2,0); C = (5,0); EE = (1.5,3); D = (1.75,1.5); draw(A--C--D); draw(B--EE--A); dot(A); dot(B); dot(C); dot(D); dot(EE); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,S); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,NE); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,EE,N); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"168\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/8/ae8e660ba366d1ce70934453ba8c53bb9ba43a92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 40^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 50^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 60^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 70^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 80^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"416\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the angles in a triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c4460b5100c3ce982ab5ebb20a8c3871e9cfdc54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />. We can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/8/bc884ed4d05dcab68b1a5296616706483c200fae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABE = 80^\\circ$\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/5/3b5ca32ffe6d42e9dcc0189ba77c02aa43537687.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CBD = 180-80=100^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"206\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b44902782037a74c37567d2dd12d73df313115d5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle BDC = 180-100-30=\\boxed{\\text{(B)}\\ 50^\\circ}\\]\" width=\"290\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of angles of a quadrilateral is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/9/cf9506d61661a7d046ee93b381ddb704684ffd15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360^\\circ$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />. Reflex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/011b41a8ec782f37b2aa339fcdd7c9cc7d21ee56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EDC=360-60-40-30=230^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"291\" height=\"16\" />.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd5529f83cca44961d418dc5a92baf90a667913c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BDC$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> is a straight angle less than Reflex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/f/52f411a4b2b4264a2ca139f595247150a3bfb597.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EDC$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/7/877970769532d7503f3d711e976c392ec86f2099.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle BDC =230-180=\\boxed{\\text{(B)}\\ 50^\\circ}\\]\" width=\"250\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME\" title=\"1994 AJHSME\">1994 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"199